    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405800/extras/3504de3cd647110db00d6cf487ccd72a.avif?t=1729768586\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR DECISION, YOUR ENDING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the mysteries of the Dreaming City and discover who you truly are\u2014melancholic, choleric, sanguine, or phlegmatic? Every choice you make will reveal hidden traits of your personality. The enigmatic disappearance of Aoi will lead you to confront not only the city's secrets but also the riddles of your own soul.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNRAVEL MYSTERIES AND DISCOVER YOURSELF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every puzzle you solve is a step closer to understanding yourself. Will you approach challenges with fiery determination like a choleric, or with calm reflection like a melancholic? It\u2019s all in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CITY THAT TESTS YOUR CHARACTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming locals and dangerous secrets\u2014can you resist temptation and stay focused on your quest? The path you choose shapes your destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to step into this visual world where every decision reveals a part of who you are?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405800/extras/3504de3cd647110db00d6cf487ccd72a.avif?t=1729768586\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR DECISION, YOUR ENDING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the mysteries of the Dreaming City and discover who you truly are\u2014melancholic, choleric, sanguine, or phlegmatic? Every choice you make will reveal hidden traits of your personality. The enigmatic disappearance of Aoi will lead you to confront not only the city's secrets but also the riddles of your own soul.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNRAVEL MYSTERIES AND DISCOVER YOURSELF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every puzzle you solve is a step closer to understanding yourself. Will you approach challenges with fiery determination like a choleric, or with calm reflection like a melancholic? It\u2019s all in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CITY THAT TESTS YOUR CHARACTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming locals and dangerous secrets\u2014can you resist temptation and stay focused on your quest? The path you choose shapes your destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to step into this visual world where every decision reveals a part of who you are?</strong></p>",
